  "releaseNotes": "- Increased robustness of range removal methods ([ad8065f](https://github.com/alastairlundy/EnhancedLinq/commit/ad8065f35b6d248e94d408d2bcd82d44a64c967f))\n- Fixed remove range extension issues ([5341697](https://github.com/alastairlundy/EnhancedLinq/commit/5341697ff1a48eabdb268ba1c41445d8e34b2d64))\n- Fixed an issue with memory exclude extensions ([39cd300](https://github.com/alastairlundy/EnhancedLinq/commit/39cd3004ec7addc04c8aee9f4357038560e9e1e9))\n- Fixed an issue where memory split was not correctly splitting ([bbc9881](https://github.com/alastairlundy/EnhancedLinq/commit/bbc9881c2f973fc5f90e83356f00bd0517238b45))\n- Fixed a potential isssue where ElementAt would iinadvertent throw an exception ([368b8d7](https://github.com/alastairlundy/EnhancedLinq/commit/368b8d7080aa07bdf78dd93e50d749e473a20230))\n- Reworked Memory ForEach ([12d259f](https://github.com/alastairlundy/EnhancedLinq/commit/12d259f73fe60500415e72bb52a1c1cf73500116))\n- Fixed issues with CountAtMost extensions ([c95b3c2](https://github.com/alastairlundy/EnhancedLinq/commit/c95b3c2757d0925b200928a4e9ad509c486cb01c))\n- Addressed a type conversion issue ([bb61a07](https://github.com/alastairlundy/EnhancedLinq/commit/bb61a076359d4fbf4463d69bce06a359e643a3be))\n- Simplified Memory LastIndex extensions ([34aa115](https://github.com/alastairlundy/EnhancedLinq/commit/34aa115abc9dcaf995dcf45287fb7621996bbc74))\n- Fixed a bug that would cause an infinite loop in Memory<T> ``AsEnumerable`` extension ([3b404d1](https://github.com/alastairlundy/EnhancedLinq/commit/3b404d11f01885c7da5c52b1085bab6b639b9ebe))",
